    "_note": "Deity-names are the Gothic-branch reflexes of the common-Germanic theonym ancestors (family_germanic.json), with Frankish-overlay variants - phoneme-morphs of the Agrippan canon, never real Germanic gods. Lawful/Neutral henotheist: the One above His ministers; Neutral kin keep the Anses (ancestral dead) and the saints at the grove and the minster.",
